From df35cbf3eba3e24da75d538d7f78267cc452f2e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:15:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Carry selected source artifacts through the continue
 tool

Fixture B reached the registered continue tool with source_path and artifacts, but the schema rejected artifacts before the handler could attach. Merely adding the field would silently lose the selection: continue registered only source_path before publication. Reuse the bound source staging producer for selection before existing continuation preflight; reject malformed lists before attaching. Omission preserves selection and explicit empty clears it, without checkpoint metadata or chat delivery.

Proof: registered handler RED 3 invalid_args; composed registry dispatch GREEN with initial/attached/published receipts and exact blob bytes; 46 source/continuation consumer files 703 passed; 4 targeted mutants killed; full scripts/check 21 checks pass. Independent bounded plan reviewed; final exact-head review and required CI remain required. Live fixture acceptance is not claimed.
